module

public import Minimality.Type29SAT.TriData

@[expose] public section

/-!
# L3, part 9: every route of the triple table is sound (generated by B29TabGen.lean)

One line per used triple: ZC (three edges on three points, closing a cycle: d_ab + d_bc = d_ac), ZQ (in a quad facet), FAC (facet route),
B4 (four points, three in a facet), AT (bracket, line or triple atom).
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 0
set_option maxRecDepth 100000
open scoped RealInnerProductSpace
open Classical

namespace Minimality.H29.SAT

/-- **Every route of the triple table gives the three valued sign of its determinant**, for a shape with the
facet facts `FacOK` and the chirality orientations `OriOK`.  No nonzero hypothesis. -/
